
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8001

# Gia tri mau - KHONG commit token/cookie that
@csrfToken = THAY_TOKEN_KHI_KIEM_THU
@sessionCookie = PHPSESSID=THAY_SESSION_KHI_KIEM_THU

### 1. Tim kiem san pham - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/san-pham.php?q=ao

### 2. San pham khong ton tai - 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/san-pham.php?id=999999

### 3. Them vao gio hang hop le - 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gio-hang.php
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{
  "san_pham_id": 1,
  "so_luong": 2
}

### 4. So luong am - 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gio-hang.php
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{
  "san_pham_id": 1,
  "so_luong": -3
}

### 5. Token CSRF sai - 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gio-hang.php
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: token-sai
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{
  "san_pham_id": 1,
  "so_luong": 1
}

### 6. Xem gio hang - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gio-hang.php
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
